    "Strengths": [
      "The campaign leverages the growing interest in health and wellness, tapping into the trend of using technology to monitor and improve health.",
      "Incorporating competition and prizes can motivate users to participate more actively and consistently, potentially leading to better health outcomes.",
      "Utilizing Nestlé products within the app encourages brand integration and product placement, potentially increasing sales and brand loyalty."
    ],
    "Weaknesses": [
      "The campaign's success heavily depends on the quality and usability of the app, requiring significant investment in app development and maintenance.",
      "There may be concerns about privacy and data security, especially regarding personal health information.",
      "The focus on Nestlé products might limit the appeal to users who prefer or require alternative dietary options not offered by Nestlé.",
      "It risks being perceived as a marketing ploy rather than a genuine effort to improve health outcomes, which could alienate some of the target audience."
    ]
  },
